{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected: move and take it, check properties and do specific task. If not, scan environment.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    />            <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />            <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />          <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />          <Condition ID = IsObjectInArea    />         <Action ID = MoveTowardsArea    />         <Action ID = ScanEnvironment    />",
    "BT": {
